    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "LIBELLUS DE MORIBUS.",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.1.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.1.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "I. Omne peccatum actio est. Actio autem omnis voluntaria est tam honesta quam lurpis; ergo volun­ tarium est omne peccatum.",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.1.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.1.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Tolle excusationem ; nemo peccat invitus. Educatio et disciplina mores faciunt ; et id unusquisque sapit, quod didicit.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.1.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.1.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Itaque bona consuetudo excutere debet quod mala instruxit. Nihil interest quo animo facias quod fecisse vitiosum est, quia facta cernuntur, animus vero non videtur.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.1.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.1.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nulla autem laus est non facere quod facere non pos­ sis. Quid homini est inimicissimum ?",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.1.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.1.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Homo. Liben­ ter feras quod necesse est; dolor patientia vincitur. Exspecta quo nunquam pœniteas.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.1.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.1.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Non quam multis placeas, sed qualibus stude. In hoc tantum ineumbe, ut libentius audias quam loquaris.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.1.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.1.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Multos vitam dif­ ferentes mors juncta praevenit. Itaque omnis dies velut ultimus judlcetur.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.1.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.1.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "TriStitiam, si potes, ne ad­ miseris; sin minus; ne ostenderis. Amicos secreto admone, palam autem lauda.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.1.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.1.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Verba rehus, non per­ ionis aestimanda sunt. Oratorem te puta, si tibi ante omnes quod oportet perSuaseris.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.1.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.1.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ut licentiosa man­ cipia animi, imperio coerce linguam, ventrem et li­ bidinem. Quod tacitum esse velis, nemini dixeris.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.1.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.1.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si tibi non imperasti, quomodo ab alio silentium spe­ ras? Ridiculum est aliquem odio nocentis innocen­ tiam perdere.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.2.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.2.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "II. Monstro similis cst avaritia senilis. Quid enim stultius est; quod dici solet, quam via deiiciente via­ licum augere?",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.2.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.2.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Omnes infanies terra nudos eXcipit. Non pudet te fortius nasci quati vivere? Quid dul­ cius quam habere amicum cum quo audeas ut tecum omnia loqui?",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.2.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.2.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Magnarum virium est negligere læden­ tem. Quid sis interest, non quid habeas. Nondum es felix si te turba non deriserit.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.2.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.2.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si vis beatus esse, co­ gita hoc priinum, contemnere et contemni. Prius quam promittas deliberes ; et cum promiseris, fa­ cias.",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.2.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.2.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Id agas, ne quis merito te oderit ; et si nullos inimicos tibi faciet injuria, multos facit invidia.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.2.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.2.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "So­ litudinem quaeret, qui vult cum innocentibus vivere; optimus ergo animus et pulcherrimus cultor Dei est.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.2.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.2.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Abstinebis ab alieno matrimonio. Præstabis parenti­ bus pittatem, cognatis indulgentiam, omnibus aequi­ tatem.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.2.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.2.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Devitabis cruudelitatem, et ministram crudeli- tatis iram. Non aliter vivas in solitudine, aliter in foro.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.2.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.2.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nihil petas, quod negaturus fuisti : nihil nega­ bis, quod petiturus fuisti. Pacem cum hominibus ha- bebis, cum vitiis bellum.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.2.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.2.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hoc habet omnis affectus, Ut in quod ipse insanit, in id putet etiam cæteros furere.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.2.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.2.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Maximum in eo vitium est, qui non meliori­ bus vult placere, sed pluribus. Vis omnibus esse no­ tus?",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.2.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.2.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "prius effice ut nominem noveris. Bonum est non laudari, et esse laudabilem. Stultum est timere quod vitare non potes.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.3.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.3.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "III. Male opinentur de te homines, sed mall. Ma- lis displicere, est laudari.",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.3.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.3.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Male de te loquuntur ho­ mines, bene autem loqui nesciont; non quod merea­ ris, sed quod solent ipsi.",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.3.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.3.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Homines de te mala loquun­ tur? Si merito, non quod loquuntur molestum est, sed quod non mentiuntur.",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.3.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.3.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si immerito? Innocentia mea nunc maiine gaudeo; apparet enim illos vera objecturos, si possent. Non es in patria tua?",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.3.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.3.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Patria tua cst, ubicunque bene es; illud enim per quod bene cst, non est in loco, sed in homine.",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.3.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.3.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nihil ma­ gnum, nisi magno animo despicias. Quæ sunt maii­ mæ divitiæ? Non desiderare divitias.",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.3.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.3.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quis plurimum habet ? Is qui minimum cupit. Quid est dare beueft­ cium ? Deum imitari.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.3.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.3.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Honestius est cum judioaveris amare, quam cum amaveris judicare. Dissensio ab alio incipiat, a le autem reconciliatio.",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.3.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.3.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Succurre pau- perlati amicorum, imo occurre. Amicos secundae res parant, adversae certissime probant.",
    "chunk_index": 32,
    "context_before": null,
