  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.3.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.3.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ava­ ritia. Pecuniæ imperare oportet, non servire. Nul­ lum conscium peccatorum tuorum magis timueris quam temetipsum.",
    "chunk_index": 36,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.3.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.3.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Alium potes effugere, te antem nunquam. Quis est pauper? Qui sibi videtur. Qui a multis timetur, multos timet.",
    "chunk_index": 37,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.3.s15",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.3.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Infelicem erige, sub­ mitte felicitatem. Vera felicitas innocentia est. Ne­ quitia ipsa sui poena est.",
    "chunk_index": 38,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.3.s16",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.3.s16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Mala conscientia saepe tuta est, secura qui exitum cogitabit. Beneficii accepti nunquam oportet oblivisci; dati, protinus.",
    "chunk_index": 39,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.4.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.4.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "IV. Inhonesta victoria est, suoS vincere. Salis est poenarum, potuisse punire. Inimicitias tarde suscipe, amicitias exerce moderate.",
    "chunk_index": 40,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
