    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.4.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.4.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Simultates depone. Imago animi, sermo est. Qualis vir, talis oratio. Magna res est vocis et silentii temperamentum.",
    "chunk_index": 41,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.4.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.4.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Qui æquo animo malis immiscetur, malus est. Neminem laudaveris, neminem cito accusaris : semper puta te cun diis testimonium dicere.",
    "chunk_index": 42,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.4.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.4.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Vitium est omnia cre dere, vitiumnihil credere. Utendum est divitiis, non abutendum. Nullum putaveris locum sine teste.",
    "chunk_index": 43,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.4.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.4.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ex cusationem quaerere, vitium. Fortior est qui cupidi tatem vincit quam qui hostem subjicit. Est difficilli­ mum, se ipsum vincere.",
    "chunk_index": 44,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.4.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.4.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Inique irascitur, qui suis irascitur. Amare sic incipe, tanquam non liceat de­ sinere.",
    "chunk_index": 45,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.4.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.4.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Magnarum rerum etiam si successus non fuerit, honestus est ipse conatus. Nobilitas animi est generositas sensus; nobilitas corporis, generosus animus.",
    "chunk_index": 46,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.4.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.4.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Honestior est quem senectus ad otium retu­ lit, quam quem in otio invenit, et tunc incipit labo­ rare.",
    "chunk_index": 47,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.4.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.4.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Turpe spectaculum præbet animus æger. Nun­ quam sit tristis facies tibi in commodo alterius.",
    "chunk_index": 48,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.4.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.4.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Homo sum : quomodo devitabo secundarum rerum invidiam? Si felicitatem jactaveris, cum multis dives eris. Quomodo optime potentiam tuebor?",
    "chunk_index": 49,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.4.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.4.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Impoten­ tia occasionis. Locum tenet innocentiæ proximum confessio. Ubi confessio, ibi remissio. Iræ severitas in vitio est.",
    "chunk_index": 50,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.4.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.4.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Boni juJicis est dispensare, non tantum quid damnandum sit, sed quatenus. Proximus justi­ tiæ modus, severitas.",
    "chunk_index": 51,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.5.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.5.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "V. Quietissimam vitam agerent homines in terris, si haec duo verba a natura omnium rerum tollerent, meum et tuum.",
    "chunk_index": 52,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.5.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.5.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Qui paupertatem timet, timendus est. Vires tuas amici magis sentiant beneficiis quam injuriis.",
    "chunk_index": 53,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.5.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.5.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Pecunia non satiat avaritiam, sed irritat. Homo semper indigens pecunia, scit cum ejus mo­ ribus convenire.",
    "chunk_index": 54,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.5.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.5.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Mihi crede, non potes dives esse et felix. Auribus frequentius quam lingua utere. Quidquid dicturus es, ante quam aliis , dixeris libi.",
    "chunk_index": 55,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.5.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.5.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nibil interest inter iratum et insanum, nisi unus . dies : alter non semper irascitur, alter semper in­ sanit. Facillime bonus fueris , si ea vitaveris quae vituperaveris.",
    "chunk_index": 56,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.5.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.5.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cum alienos timueris, te ipsum ve­ rere: nam saepe sine aliis esse potes, sine le nun­ quam.",
    "chunk_index": 57,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.5.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.5.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si bene te instruxeris , pudeat deteriora facere. Quod persuaseris erit diuturnum, quod coe­ geris erit in occasione.",
    "chunk_index": 58,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.5.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.5.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Alteri semper ignoscito, tibi ipsi nunquam. Tantum ad virtutem adjicies, quantum ex voluptate abstraxeris.",
    "chunk_index": 59,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.5.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.5.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Stultum est somno dejectari, et quasi mortem moliri. Bonis nocet, qui maiis parcit.",
    "chunk_index": 60,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.5.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.5.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Multi cum aliis maledicunt, sibi ipsis convicium faciunt. Nihil turpius quam qui objicit alteri ; sibi objiciendum.",
    "chunk_index": 61,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.5.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.5.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ut licentiosa mancipia animi, imperio rege linguam, libidinem, ventrem; cupiditatemque comprime : si non potes, paululum remitte.",
    "chunk_index": 62,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.5.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.5.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sæpe ea quae sanari ratione non poterant, sanata sunt tempore. Qui propter pecuniæ amorem et libidinum moritur, ostendit se nunquam sui causa vixisse.",
    "chunk_index": 63,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
    "date_range": [
      556,
      580
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu#PL72.OPU.5.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/martinus-bracarensis/pl72_3_opu",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.OPU.5.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Turpia ne dixeris, paulatim enim pudor per verba discutitur. Sic habita, ut potius laudetur do­ minus quam domus : consuetudinaria res est inno­ centia.",
    "chunk_index": 64,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 568,
